      "en": "When Jeroboam the son of Nebat heard of it (for he was yet in Egypt, where he had fled from the presence of King Solomon, and Jeroboam lived in Egypt;",
      "ko": "느밧의 아들 여로보암이 전에 솔로몬왕의 얼굴을 피하여 애굽으로 도망하여 있었더니 이제 그 소문을 듣고 오히려 애굽에 있는 중에",
      "source_text_hash": "0f143aa927ca4ca393e4fbc1c4510283dd4e9c1f85e6871cfd16a76f93085a15",
      "translation_text_hash": "f99dc830d76c3222d2550846f4b6bb3f7c31ecdae49a4ab8a2ac584356f432fb",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
