        "verse": 18
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "1KI",
          "chapter": 12,
          "verse": 18
        }
      ],
      "en": "Then King Rehoboam sent Adoram, who was over the men subject to forced labor; and all Israel stoned him to death with stones. King Rehoboam hurried to get himself up to his chariot, to flee to Jerusalem.",
      "ko": "르호보암왕이 역군의 감독 아도니람을 보내었더니 온 이스라엘이 저를 돌로 쳐 죽인지라 르호보암왕이 급히 수레에 올라 예루살렘으로 도망하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "d16efdf9ed6aafc8315629db7e282b86765f607d27bc26af82b2dd4988fa143b",
      "translation_text_hash": "d9a1ca3e184b93279b0b261838a52768e074c3f02ea7a6908652c133e5f3c7c0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
