      "en": "Then Jeroboam built Shechem in the hill country of Ephraim, and lived in it; and he went out from there and built Penuel.",
      "ko": "여로보암이 에브라임 산지에 세겜을 건축하고 거기서 살며 또 거기서 나가서 부느엘을 건축하고",
      "source_text_hash": "f2caaf277577d53cd17868e95c8e30005309cfb940773ec612bee24dad8c3264",
