      "en": "He made houses of high places, and made priests from among all the people, who were not of the sons of Levi.",
      "ko": "저가 또 산당들을 짓고 레위 자손 아닌 보통 백성으로 제사장을 삼고",
      "source_text_hash": "ccb68f2aa9da9395d6de100e41c48f3ffb3f61f57d0934bd91b6dce161516bce",
      "translation_text_hash": "428ed9f7d2bd1ba61592ed218834554b7185fe1a81d9a319d91c51a17f24742e",
